 for the entity spans, working through the complement findings and the renal biopsy line by line. I'm checking the spans for \"pneumonia,\" \"mesangiopathic glomerulonephritis,\" and the \"C3 deficiency\" mentions against the running positions.\n\nI'm counting character offsets for the spans after the mesangiopathic glomerulonephritis entity, working through the \"management of severe pyogenic infections in patients with C3 deficiency\" line. I'm placing the second \"C3 deficiency\" span at 1055 to 1068.\n\n", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "{\"annotations\":[{\"start\":10,\"end\":23,\"text\":\"C3 deficiency\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"C3 deficiency is a single, well-defined complement disorder, analogous to the C7 deficiency example. The qualifier 'Inherited' is optional and omitted to keep the minimum necessary span.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Specific Disease); Examples 6 and 5\"},{\"start\":54,\"end\":72,\"text\":\"glomerulonephritis\",\"entity\":\"DiseaseClass\",\"rationale\":\"Glomerulonephritis denotes a family of multiple distinct kidney diseases rather than one specific disease, so it is a Disease Class.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Disease Class)\"},{\"start\":104,\"end\":162,\"text\":\"homozygous deficiency of the third component of complement\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"The phrase describes the specific disease C3 deficiency (homozygous form) and is preferred as the whole defined phrase over substrings.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Specific Disease); What to Annotate 5 (minimum necessary span)\"},{\"start\":590,\"end\":599,\"text\":\"pneumonia\",\"entity\":\"DiseaseClass\",\"rationale\":\"Pneumonia is a broad family of multiple specific infectious lung diseases (bacterial, viral, etc.), so it is a Disease Class.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Disease Class)\"},{\"start\":705,\"end\":738,\"text\":\"mesangiopathic glomerulonephritis\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Mesangiopathic glomerulonephritis is one specific histological form of glomerulonephritis with a single definition, so it is a Specific Disease; the whole phrase is preferred.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Specific Disease); What to Annotate 5 (minimum necessary span)\"},{\"start\":875,\"end\":888,\"text\":\"C3 deficiency\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Refers again to the specific disease C3 deficiency, which is a single defined disorder.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Specific Disease); Examples 6\"},{\"start\":894,\"end\":916,\"text\":\"immune-complex disease\",\"entity\":\"DiseaseClass\",\"rationale\":\"Immune-complex disease refers to a family of diseases mediated by immune complexes rather than one specific disease, so it is a Disease Class.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Disease Class); Examples 10 and 11\"},{\"start\":1055,\"end\":1068,\"text\":\"C3 deficiency\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Refers to the specific disease C3 deficiency in the final sentence; it is a single defined disorder and is annotated as a separate mention.\",\"guideline_section\":\"What to Annotate 1 (Specific Disease); What to Annotate 4 (duplicate mentions)\"}]}", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3925, "output_tokens": 13453, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 12434}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}